三条命令，按顺序跑。

## 1. 把 fusion 分支拨回去

```bash
git branch -f affine-fusion-recurrence-slice fork/affine-fusion-recurrence-slice
```

## 2. 改 XeVM 代码

```bash
cat > /tmp/fixxevm.py <<'PYEOF'
import sys, os
SRC = "mlir/lib/Dialect/GPU/Pipelines/GPUToXeVMPipeline.cpp"
if not os.path.isfile(SRC):
    sys.exit("error: run from the root of your llvm-project checkout")
s = open(SRC).read()

OLD = """    pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(
        arith::createArithEmulateUnsupportedFloats(arithEmulateOptions));
  }
  pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(createCSEPass());
  pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(createReconcileUnrealizedCastsPass());"""

NEW = """    pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(
        arith::createArithEmulateUnsupportedFloats(arithEmulateOptions));
  }
  // Lower whatever Math ops are left. `convert-math-to-xevm` above only maps
  // the ops that have a native or OpenCL counterpart; the rest (e.g.
  // `math.isinf`) have no XeVM lowering and would otherwise survive into
  // serialization, where translation to LLVM IR fails. This must run after the
  // XeVM-specific conversions so those keep taking priority.
  pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(createConvertMathToLLVMPass());
  pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(createCSEPass());
  pm.addNestedPass<gpu::GPUModuleOp>(createReconcileUnrealizedCastsPass());"""

n = s.count(OLD)
if n != 1:
    sys.exit("error: matched %d times, expected 1" % n)
open(SRC, "w").write(s.replace(OLD, NEW))
print("patched " + SRC)
PYEOF
python3 /tmp/fixxevm.py
```

## 3. 编译

```bash
ninja -C build mlir-opt
```

